    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 8th level, the dragoon can make a trip combat maneuver with his polearm or spear against creatures within an area that he threatens as a standard action. The affected area must consist of at least three contiguous squares. Additionally, the dragoon receives a bonus to this combat maneuver check equal to half his dragoon level. This action does not provoke attacks of opportunity, and does not cause the dragoon to fall prone should he fail his check by 10 or more.</p>",
